                    "[의자]"@sv ,
                    "[의자]"@de ,
                    "[의자]"@es ,
                    "[의자]"@fr ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The block 의 starts with a silent ㅇ, not a consonant sound, and it opens the word, so ㅢ keeps its full sound."@en ,
